{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは。\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は個別握手会でした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11/3だけ関東３部制だったので\nなんとなく物足りなく感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたくさんの方が来てくれて\n本当に嬉しかったです*\\(^o^)/*\nいつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１3th初めての握手会ということで\nいつもより「はじめまして」さんが\n凄く多かった気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何をきっかけに『行ってみよう♪』\nってなったかは定かではありませんが\n興味を持ってくれるのは\n本当に嬉しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服はこんな感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から早起きして\n握手会に来てくれた人のために\n脚全開にしてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝っぱらからすみませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２部\n珍しくおでこのちょい出し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともとおでこが広くて\nあまり出したくなかったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべての犬は天国へ行くの\nキービジュアルでおでこ出したら、\n意外と好評だったみたいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おでこ出してみて〜〜っていう\nリクエストをたくさん頂いたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なりに頑張って出しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょい出しですがこちらも好評で\n嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"単純なのでまたやろうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３部\n(写真なくてごめんなさい)\n1部のトップスに黒いパンツに\nポニーテール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会は会話をしたりするのも\n楽しいのですが\nお洋服を考えるのも楽しいんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントとか見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ着てみよっかな\nとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この髪型やってみようかな〜\nとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１１月は個握があと２回もあるので\n何か新内に似合いそうなのがあったら\n是非コメント待ってます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべてに応えられるわけではないですが\nいろんな意見聞きたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなかんじですが\n13枚目もよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウーマンインサイトさんの連載"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川さんとの\n４回の連載が終わりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第1回\nhttp://www.womaninsight.jp/archives/171137"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第2回\nhttp://www.womaninsight.jp/archives/173459"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第3回\nhttp://www.womaninsight.jp/archives/173754"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第4回\nhttp://www.womaninsight.jp/archives/173824"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってしまったのは\n残念ですが、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力に迫って頂いたので\n是非見てみて下さいね〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ぷぷぷ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の乃木坂ぷぷぷでは\nナレーションとして出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたよ！って方と\n気付かなかった！って方\n半々くらいで面白かったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆにばーすのはらさんに\n触発されて載せた\n初公開写真の原画はこちらです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのうち本編にもお邪魔するので\nテレビ埼玉が映る地域の方は\n是非見てくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週土曜日 24:30〜です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新宿芸術天国2015"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し遅くなりましたが\n夢だったのでどうしても書きたくて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新宿スタイルコレクションで\nANNA SUIのお洋服を着て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッドカーペットを\n歩かせて頂きましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/11/04/4549429/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもとは少し違うメイクで\n普段では買えないような値段の\nお洋服を着て、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新宿のど真ん中のランウェイを\n歩くなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさに夢のような空間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちの前には\nプロの外国人モデルさんが\nパキッとランウェイを歩いてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く感動したし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せだったな〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこういう事が出来るように\n頑張ろうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2015年もあと少し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間を大事に\nたくさんの縁に感謝をして\n過ごしていきたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます。"}],"source":"archive"}